		width: 16px;
		height: 16px;
		flex: none;
		fill: none;
		stroke: currentColor;
		stroke-width: 2;
		stroke-linecap: round;
		stroke-linejoin: round;
	}

	/* The first row: search, the two menus, New in the preview, Reset. */
	.mt-cat__bar {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		align-items: center;
	}
