		margin: 3.5rem auto 0;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
